    "Imigrasi mensyaratkan surat pernyataan kedua orang tua yang bertanggung jawab atas paspor anak. Karena ayah di luar negeri: ayah menandatangani pernyataan (dan surat kuasa) dengan tinta basah lalu mengirimnya. Telepon kantor Imigrasi dulu: apakah pernyataan dari luar negeri diterima, perlu legalisasi atau tidak, dan apakah ibu boleh datang sendiri.": "Immigration requires a statement from both parents who take responsibility for the child's passport. Because the father is abroad: the father signs the statement (and the power of attorney) in wet ink and sends it. Call the Immigration office first: do they accept a statement from abroad, does it need legalisation or not, and may the mother come alone.",
