    "Per dokumen. Halaman resmi tidak menampilkan tarif; potongan pencarian menyebut AED 150 Kedutaan + AED 150 MoFA. Ditambah biaya layanan VFS/BLS dan kurir (tidak kembali bila ditolak).": "Per document. The official page does not show the fee; a search snippet says AED 150 Embassy + AED 150 MoFA. Plus VFS/BLS and courier service fees (not refunded if rejected).",
    "Per dokumen. Matriks PNBP AHU (PP 28/2019) Rp 50.000; berita PP 30/2026 (mulai 1 Agustus 2026) menyebut Rp 70.000. Belum terkonfirmasi: lihat angka di aplikasi sebelum membayar.": "Per document. AHU PNBP matrix (PP 28/2019) Rp 50.000; news on PP 30/2026 (from 1 August 2026) says Rp 70.000. Not confirmed: check the amount in the app before paying.",
    "Per orang. Halaman ICP: biaya permohonan 100, penerbitan 100, layanan pintar 100 (tidak berlabel per kategori). Law Reporters (sekunder, Agustus 2024, Abu Dhabi) menyebut juga deposit AED 5.025; ICP hanya mencantumkan \"biaya deposit 20\". Tidak bisa dipastikan: lihat layar pembayaran ICP.": "Per person. ICP page: application fee 100, issuance 100, smart service 100 (not labelled by category). Law Reporters (secondary, August 2024, Abu Dhabi) also mentions a deposit of AED 5.025; ICP only lists a \"deposit fee 20\". Cannot be confirmed: check the ICP payment screen.",
    "Per orang. ICP: permohonan 100 + penerbitan izin tinggal per tahun 100 + layanan pintar 100; Emirates ID terpisah. Angka sekunder berbeda jauh (lihat catatan entry permit).": "Per person. ICP: application 100 + residence permit issuance per year 100 + smart service 100; Emirates ID is separate. Secondary figures differ a lot (see the entry permit note).",
