    "Tanda tangan pejabat di buku nikah disahkan Kemenag sebelum Kemenkum. Isi formulir di loket, petugas memeriksa keabsahan, lalu buku nikah dilegalisir. Karena suami di luar negeri, istri bisa mengurus dengan surat kuasa dari suami.": "The official's signature in the marriage book (buku nikah) is attested by Kemenag before Kemenkum. Fill in the form at the counter, the officer checks that it is valid, then the marriage book is legalised. Because the husband is abroad, the wife can handle it with a power of attorney from the husband.",
    "Tanda tangan pejabat kampus disahkan Kementerian Hukum dengan stiker legalisasi. Untuk UAE dipakai legalisasi biasa, bukan Apostille.": "The signature of the university official is attested by the Kementerian Hukum with a legalisation sticker. For the UAE, ordinary legalisation is used, not Apostille.",
