    "Total untuk {0} dokumen ({1} AED masing-masing). Per dokumen. Halaman resmi tidak menampilkan tarif; potongan pencarian menyebut AED {2} Kedutaan + AED {3} MoFA. Ditambah biaya layanan VFS/BLS dan kurir (tidak kembali bila ditolak).": "Total for {0} documents ({1} AED each). Per document. The official page does not show the fee; a search snippet gives AED {2} Embassy + AED {3} MoFA. Plus VFS/BLS service fee and courier (not refunded if rejected).",
    "Total untuk {0} orang ({1}-{2} AED masing-masing). Per orang. Halaman ICP: biaya permohonan {3}, penerbitan {4}, layanan pintar {5} (tidak berlabel per kategori). Law Reporters (sekunder, Agustus {6}, Abu Dhabi) menyebut juga deposit AED {7}; ICP hanya mencantumkan \"biaya deposit {8}\". Tidak bisa dipastikan: lihat layar pembayaran ICP.": "Total for {0} people ({1}-{2} AED each). Per person. ICP page: application fee {3}, issuance {4}, smart services {5} (not labelled per category). Law Reporters (secondary, August {6}, Abu Dhabi) also mention an AED {7} deposit; ICP only lists \"deposit fee {8}\". Cannot be confirmed: check the ICP payment screen.",
    "Total untuk {0} orang ({1}-{2} AED masing-masing). Per orang. ICP: permohonan {3} + penerbitan izin tinggal per tahun {4} + layanan pintar {5}; Emirates ID terpisah. Angka sekunder berbeda jauh (lihat catatan entry permit).": "Total for {0} people ({1}-{2} AED each). Per person. ICP: application {3} + residence permit issuance per year {4} + smart services {5}; Emirates ID is separate. Secondary figures differ a lot (see the entry permit note).",
